{
  "id": 8867139453127,
  "title": "Christian Bedding Set – Inspirational Bible Verse Comforte - Design 05",
  "handle": "christian-bedding-set-inspirational-bible-verse-comforte-design-05",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with this beautifully designed Christian bedding set from Jeminise, featuring inspiring Bible verses and accents. It's the perfect gift for the women in your life, ideal for birthdays, special occasions, or as a constant reminder of faith and love.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> This bedding set is an ideal faith gift for mom, daughter, or sister, and is perfect for birthdays or religious occasions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type Options:</strong> Choose between a Duvet Cover (no filling insert, two sheets sewn together) for a lightweight, customizable option or a Comforter for all-in-one warmth and convenience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Available in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each package includes 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) and (Optional) Pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel. The comforter includes whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier. Recommended to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features an inspirational Christian Art design with Bible verses and religious accents.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christian Knight Templar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Recommended to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
